---
const baseUrl = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '') || '';

const proof = [
  { label: 'TTFT', value: '1318 ms', note: 'first token' },
  { label: 'Decode', value: '≈ 9.50 tok/s', note: 'local generation' },
  { label: 'Total', value: '3451 ms', note: 'full response' },
  { label: 'Model', value: 'Qwen3.5-2B', note: 'Q4_K_M · GGUF' },
];

const principles = [
  { title: 'Explicit', text: 'Model identity and execution path stay visible.' },
  { title: 'Measurable', text: 'Latency and runtime behaviour are part of the product.' },
  { title: 'Reusable', text: 'The target is one Android gateway for multiple apps.' },
];
---

<section class="harness-hero" id="top">
  <div class="shell hero-grid">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <div class="eyebrow">ANDROID LOCAL LLM HARNESS</div>
      <h1>Local AI on Android.<br /><span>Measured on the device.</span></h1>
      <p class="lede">
        A testbed for <strong>GGUF + llama.cpp inference</strong>: pick a model, run it locally and see what actually happened.
      </p>

      <div class="decision-callout">
        <span>THE QUESTION</span>
        <strong>Can this workload actually run well on-device?</strong>
      </div>

      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a class="button primary" href="#evidence">See the evidence →</a>
        <a class="button secondary" href="https://github.com/daniele21/android-local-llm-harness" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">GitHub ↗</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="hero-shot" aria-label="Android Harness Playground screenshot">
      <div class="phone-glow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="phone-frame">
        <img
          src={`${baseUrl}/images/harness/harness-playground-current.webp`}
          alt="Harness Local AI Console showing Qwen3.5-2B running locally with TTFT, total latency and decode speed."
          loading="eager"
        />
      </div>
      <div class="shot-note"><span></span> Real Harness run · Android</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="proof-band" id="evidence" aria-label="Measured Android Harness run">
  <div class="shell proof-grid">
    {proof.map((item) => (
      <div class="proof-item">
        <span>{item.label}</span>
        <strong>{item.value}</strong>
        <small>{item.note}</small>
      </div>
    ))}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section loop-section" id="workflow">
  <div class="shell">
    <div class="section-intro">
      <div>
        <div class="section-kicker">ONE DECISION LOOP</div>
        <h2>Model → answer → evidence.</h2>
      </div>
      <p>No benchmark spreadsheet first. Start with the actual workload on the actual device.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="loop-visual" aria-label="Harness workflow">
      <div class="loop-node">
        <span>01</span>
        <strong>Pick a model</strong>
        <small>GGUF · quantized</small>
      </div>
      <div class="loop-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</div>
      <div class="loop-node accent-node">
        <span>02</span>
        <strong>Run locally</strong>
        <small>llama.cpp · Android</small>
      </div>
      <div class="loop-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</div>
      <div class="loop-node teal-node">
        <span>03</span>
        <strong>Measure it</strong>
        <small>TTFT · tok/s · total</small>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section architecture-section" id="architecture">
  <div class="shell architecture-grid">
    <div class="architecture-copy">
      <div class="section-kicker">FROM CONSOLE TO GATEWAY</div>
      <h2>Today: prove the runtime.<br />Next: share it.</h2>
      <p>Harness currently runs the runtime in-process. The target architecture moves that capability behind a reusable Android gateway.</p>
      <a class="text-link" href="https://github.com/daniele21/android-local-llm-harness" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Explore the architecture on GitHub →</a>
    </div>

    <div class="architecture-map" aria-label="Current and target Harness architecture">
      <div class="architecture-lane current-lane">
        <div class="lane-head"><span class="status-dot current"></span><strong>Today</strong></div>
        <div class="lane-flow">
          <div class="arch-node">Harness app</div>
          <span>→</span>
          <div class="arch-node">Embedded runtime</div>
          <span>→</span>
          <div class="arch-node">llama.cpp + GGUF</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="lane-divider"></div>

      <div class="architecture-lane target-lane">
        <div class="lane-head"><span class="status-dot target"></span><strong>Target</strong></div>
        <div class="lane-flow target-flow">
          <div class="app-stack">
            <span>App A</span>
            <span>App B</span>
            <span>App N</span>
          </div>
          <span>→</span>
          <div class="arch-node highlighted">Binder / AIDL gateway</div>
          <span>→</span>
          <div class="arch-node">Shared runtime + model store</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section principles-section" id="why">
  <div class="shell">
    <div class="section-intro compact">
      <div>
        <div class="section-kicker">WHY HARNESS EXISTS</div>
        <h2>Infrastructure for decisions, not demos.</h2>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="principles-grid">
      {principles.map((item, index) => (
        <article class="principle">
          <span>0{index + 1}</span>
          <h3>{item.title}</h3>
          <p>{item.text}</p>
        </article>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section final-section">
  <div class="shell final-card">
    <div>
      <div class="section-kicker">ANDROID LOCAL AI LAB</div>
      <h2>The useful part starts after the first token.</h2>
      <p>Memory, lifecycle, model residency, IPC and evidence are what turn local inference into product infrastructure.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="final-actions">
      <a class="button primary" href="https://github.com/daniele21/android-local-llm-harness" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Open GitHub ↗</a>
      <a class="button secondary" href={`${baseUrl}/local-ai`}>Local AI field guide →</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .harness-hero {
    position: relative;
    overflow: clip;
    padding: clamp(48px, 7vw, 92px) 0 clamp(56px, 8vw, 96px);
  }

  .harness-hero::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    width: 520px;
    height: 520px;
    right: -180px;
    top: -160px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(124, 92, 255, .13), transparent 68%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .hero-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(320px, .68fr);
    gap: clamp(36px, 7vw, 92px);
    align-items: center;
  }

  .hero-copy { max-width: 760px; }

  .eyebrow,
  .section-kicker {
    color: #7c5cff;
    font-size: .72rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: .12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .hero-copy h1 {
    max-width: 780px;
    margin: 14px 0 0;
    color: var(--ink);
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 5.6vw, 5.2rem);
    line-height: .96;
    letter-spacing: -.055em;
  }

  .hero-copy h1 span { color: #7c5cff; }

  .lede {
    max-width: 630px;
    margin: 24px 0 0;
    color: var(--ink-muted);
    font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 1.4vw, 1.22rem);
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .decision-callout {
    display: grid;
    gap: 5px;
    max-width: 560px;
    margin-top: 26px;
    padding: 16px 18px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(124, 92, 255, .22);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(124, 92, 255, .07), rgba(45, 212, 191, .04));
  }

  .decision-callout span {
    color: #2bbfa6;
    font-size: .68rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: .12em;
  }

  .decision-callout strong {
    color: var(--ink);
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.03rem;
  }

  .hero-actions,
  .final-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-top: 28px;
  }

  .button {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    min-height: 46px;
    padding: 11px 20px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: var(--text-small);
    font-weight: 750;
    transition: transform var(--duration-fast) ease, box-shadow var(--duration-fast) ease, border-color var(--duration-fast) ease;
  }

  .button:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); }
  .button.primary { color: #fff; background: linear-gradient(90deg, #714df5, #7c5cff); box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(124, 92, 255, .24); }
  .button.secondary { color: var(--ink); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); background: var(--surface-card); }
  .button.secondary:hover { border-color: var(--border-strong); }

  .hero-shot {
    position: relative;
    justify-self: center;
    width: min(100%, 430px);
  }

  .phone-glow {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 10% -8%;
    background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 42%, rgba(124,92,255,.22), transparent 62%);
    filter: blur(24px);
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .phone-frame {
    position: relative;
    padding: 10px;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid rgba(124, 92, 255, .22);
    border-radius: 30px;
    background: #070b14;
    box-shadow: 0 30px 80px rgba(2, 6, 23, .36);
  }

  .phone-frame img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    border-radius: 22px;
  }

  .shot-note {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 8px;
    margin-top: 12px;
    color: var(--ink-subtle);
    font-size: .78rem;
    font-weight: 650;
  }

  .shot-note span {
    width: 7px;
    height: 7px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #2dd4bf;
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(45, 212, 191, .1);
  }

  .proof-band {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    background: var(--surface-muted);
  }

  .proof-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
  }

  .proof-item {
    min-width: 0;
    padding: 24px clamp(16px, 2.5vw, 28px);
    border-right: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
  }

  .proof-item:first-child { padding-left: 0; }
  .proof-item:last-child { border-right: 0; }
  .proof-item > span { display: block; color: #7c5cff; font-size: .68rem; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: .1em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .proof-item strong { display: block; margin-top: 6px; color: var(--ink); font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: clamp(1.2rem, 2vw, 1.7rem); white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; }
  .proof-item small { display: block; margin-top: 4px; color: var(--ink-subtle); font-size: .76rem; }

  .section-intro {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, .9fr) minmax(260px, .55fr);
    gap: 36px;
    align-items: end;
    margin-bottom: 34px;
  }

  .section-intro.compact { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .section-intro h2,
  .architecture-copy h2,
  .final-card h2 {
    margin: 8px 0 0;
    color: var(--ink);
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.8vw, 3.4rem);
    line-height: 1.04;
    letter-spacing: -.04em;
  }
  .section-intro > p,
  .architecture-copy > p,
  .final-card p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--ink-muted);
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .loop-visual {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr auto 1fr auto 1fr;
    gap: 14px;
    align-items: stretch;
  }

  .loop-node {
    padding: clamp(20px, 3vw, 30px);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    background: var(--surface-card);
  }

  .loop-node > span { display: block; color: var(--ink-subtle); font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: .72rem; font-weight: 800; }
  .loop-node strong { display: block; margin-top: 20px; color: var(--ink); font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 1.18rem; }
  .loop-node small { display: block; margin-top: 6px; color: var(--ink-muted); }
  .accent-node { border-color: rgba(124,92,255,.28); background: linear-gradient(150deg, var(--surface-card), rgba(124,92,255,.07)); }
  .teal-node { border-color: rgba(45,212,191,.24); background: linear-gradient(150deg, var(--surface-card), rgba(45,212,191,.06)); }
  .loop-arrow { display: grid; place-items: center; color: #7c5cff; font-size: 1.4rem; }

  .architecture-section { background: var(--surface-muted); }
  .architecture-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, .7fr) minmax(0, 1.3fr); gap: clamp(40px, 7vw, 88px); align-items: center; }
  .architecture-copy > p { margin-top: 18px; max-width: 520px; }
  .text-link { display: inline-block; margin-top: 22px; color: #7c5cff; text-decoration: none; font-size: var(--text-small); font-weight: 750; }

  .architecture-map {
    padding: clamp(22px, 3vw, 32px);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    background: var(--surface-card);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
  }

  .architecture-lane { display: grid; gap: 16px; }
  .lane-head { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px; color: var(--ink); font-size: .82rem; }
  .status-dot { width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; }
  .status-dot.current { background: #2dd4bf; }
  .status-dot.target { background: #7c5cff; }
  .lane-flow { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) auto minmax(0, 1fr) auto minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 10px; align-items: center; }
  .lane-flow > span { color: var(--ink-subtle); text-align: center; }
  .arch-node,
  .app-stack span {
    padding: 13px 12px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    background: var(--surface-muted);
    color: var(--ink);
    text-align: center;
    font-size: .78rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .arch-node.highlighted { border-color: rgba(124,92,255,.35); background: rgba(124,92,255,.08); }
  .app-stack { display: grid; gap: 5px; }
  .app-stack span { padding: 7px 10px; font-size: .7rem; }
  .lane-divider { height: 1px; margin: 24px 0; background: var(--border-subtle); }

  .principles-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 14px; }
  .principle { padding: clamp(22px, 3vw, 30px); border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); }
  .principle > span { color: #7c5cff; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: .7rem; font-weight: 800; }
  .principle h3 { margin: 16px 0 0; color: var(--ink); font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 1.2rem; }
  .principle p { margin: 8px 0 0; color: var(--ink-muted); line-height: 1.6; font-size: var(--text-small); }

  .final-card {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) auto;
    gap: 32px;
    align-items: end;
    padding: clamp(28px, 5vw, 52px);
    border: 1px solid rgba(124,92,255,.24);
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--surface-card), rgba(124,92,255,.06));
  }
  .final-card p { max-width: 760px; margin-top: 14px; }
  .final-actions { justify-content: flex-end; margin-top: 0; }

  @media (max-width: 1040px) {
    .hero-grid,
    .architecture-grid,
    .final-card { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .hero-shot { width: min(72vw, 420px); }
    .final-actions { justify-content: flex-start; }
  }

  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .proof-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
    .proof-item { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); }
    .proof-item:nth-child(2) { border-right: 0; }
    .proof-item:nth-child(3), .proof-item:nth-child(4) { border-bottom: 0; }
    .proof-item:nth-child(3) { padding-left: 0; }
    .section-intro { grid-template-columns: 1fr; align-items: start; }
    .loop-visual { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .loop-arrow { transform: rotate(90deg); }
    .lane-flow { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .lane-flow > span { transform: rotate(90deg); }
    .principles-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .hero-shot { width: min(88vw, 400px); }
  }

  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    .hero-actions,
    .final-actions { flex-direction: column; }
    .button { width: 100%; }
    .proof-item strong { font-size: 1.12rem; }
    .hero-shot { width: 100%; }
  }
</style>